{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40787","headline":"题青城山范贤观 · 唐求","name":"题青城山范贤观","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"数里缘山不厌难，爲寻真诀问黄冠。\n苔铺翠点仙桥滑，松织香梢古道寒。\n昼傍绿畦薅嫩玉，夜开红竈捻新丹。\n钟声已断泉声在，风动茅花月满坛。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"唐求","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_40787.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_40787","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}